Derived files, each carrying a comment naming its upstream source:

  hypr/omarchy-bindings.lua   <- default/hypr/bindings/*.lua
  hypr/omarchy-looknfeel.lua  <- default/hypr/looknfeel.lua
  hypr/omarchy-windows.lua    <- default/hypr/windows.lua, default/hypr/apps/*.lua
