These are translations from Omarchy's own o.bind() / o.window() helpers to the
stock Hyprland Lua API, and some of Omarchy's comments are kept verbatim.

Omarchy's themes and templates are NOT redistributed here. The README's install
steps fetch them from Omarchy directly.

Everything else is original to this repository: bin/*, config/waybar/*,
config/walker/*, config/gamemode.ini, config/MangoHud.conf, hypr/hypridle.conf
and hypr/hyprlock.conf. The waybar configuration is an interpretation of
Omarchy's look, not a copy of an upstream file -- Omarchy 4.0 ships herdr rather
than waybar, and has no walker theme at all.


